        "name": "取得標註檔路徑",
        "func": "// 取得 msg.filename 完整的圖檔名稱\nlet baseName = msg.filename\n// 刪除副檔名，只保留檔名\nlet nameWithoutExtension = baseName.substring(0, baseName.lastIndexOf('.'));\n// 建立YOLO標註檔的路徑\nmsg.textFilePath = msg.filePath + \"labels\\\\\" + nameWithoutExtension + \".txt\";\n\nreturn msg;\n",
